{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the birthplace of drift and dive into Japan\u2019s iconic car culture!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JDM: Japanese Drift Master</strong> is an homage to Japan, Japanese street racing culture and drift. It\u2019s an open world, story-driven experience, blending T\u014dge (mountainous) serpentines, with narrow rural roads and vast highways leading to a modern cityscape. With licensed cars and robust tuning options it\u2019s a drifting paradise come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/01880f9a3c02c43b93b85dfd7359b491.avif?t=1769612693\" width=610 height=152 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving Models</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed primarily for gamepads, JDM boasts two driving models to choose from: Arcade, suited for a more relaxed experience and drift beginners; and Simcade in which all assists are off, trading full control over the car for more skill requirements to manage drifting. Players can switch between both models at any time during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d5845ea8e0946f381088a6af8430410c.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d5845ea8e0946f381088a6af8430410c.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d5845ea8e0946f381088a6af8430410c.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soak in the atmosphere of Japan with the fictional prefecture of Guntama, created through mixing real-life locations from all over the country. With over 250 km of visually stunning main roads, standalone racing tracks and instanced events, set across winding mountain passes, rural areas and the city's bustling streets, you\u2019ll explore diverse landscapes featuring traffic, dynamic weather, and day-night cycle systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/e75a5799300bcf2f77b21e283a0bc661.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/e75a5799300bcf2f77b21e283a0bc661.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/e75a5799300bcf2f77b21e283a0bc661.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licensed Cars</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit behind the wheel of legendary Nissan, Honda, Subaru and Mazda cars. Tune them mechanically with new parts and then fine tune the details. Experiment with visual parts: from hoods, through lights to full body kit swaps. Adjust the suspension, wheel camber, gear ratios and more. Finally, paint the car however you like using a free pick color palette. You want underglow? It\u2019s at your disposal as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/fd118425d6651ab943210da8d1c3f0ad.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/fd118425d6651ab943210da8d1c3f0ad.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/fd118425d6651ab943210da8d1c3f0ad.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven Campaign</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a foreigner determined to make his mark on the Japanese drifting scene. Compete in 40+ narrative-driven events and additional sidequests against the top drifters in the area. Experience this journey through hand-drawn manga pages, which add a unique and artistic touch to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d1d0eac16fa15ccbf2bc6a435ddae5ea.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d1d0eac16fa15ccbf2bc6a435ddae5ea.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d1d0eac16fa15ccbf2bc6a435ddae5ea.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Audio Purr</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience authentic car sounds, captured through original recordings and brought to life with attention to detail, making you feel like you're truly behind the wheel. Cruise along picturesque roads while tuning in to genre-themed radio stations, including unique soundscapes of J-music, Phonk and even Eurobeat -  choose the perfect soundtrack for your drive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/07819ac7a8bf5782fda5166554cf53b2.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/07819ac7a8bf5782fda5166554cf53b2.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/07819ac7a8bf5782fda5166554cf53b2.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Oni Rider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/87a9350edf6e182e396727b7ce417f1396d8f199.jpg"},{"name":"Gaijin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/7ec96b37563292d5ef8b130449cecaa49ad8ca3e.jpg"},{"name":"Tourist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/1952b33e9a66dbc591b0f6e2ef8a55488c5a9a5d.jpg"},{"name":"Dojin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/dbbfa6aaddcc96fa4198a7f03ae24a16524ce9b3.jpg"},{"name":"Sliding is fun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/72c00cff1d9c393a5d5aed08fe964c774ab6fe41.jpg"},{"name":"Drift Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/8bd6959524e48476e651f193e3ef87ec6dfa28d9.jpg"},{"name":"Did you ever drive straight?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/531cf042910c7200024de4af6d27a8a7079d6b51.jpg"},{"name":"Drift Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/f222ca044269c5e2f2992ee33357bb1a32280268.jpg"},{"name":"Tire Shredder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/1b744d246795107e6fa89abb6d877f24532ffb14.jpg"},{"name":"Fast as lightning.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153410/2fc3794779a15818f0e20fff6a3b48fbda94cdd5.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1153410?t=1769612693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/156ff16038a9a737b9a02708413f2da46c5dbf44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769612693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/b22e93dace67af889ada3471f3e4f064d72b29d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769612693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/b22e93dace67af889ada3471f3e4f064d72b29d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769612693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/6b9549debb21796cb3222a8d6ca7fa69.avif?t=1769612693\" width=616 height=2624 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the birthplace of drift and dive into Japan\u2019s iconic car culture!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JDM: Japanese Drift Master</strong> is an homage to Japan, Japanese street racing culture and drift. It\u2019s an open world, story-driven experience, blending T\u014dge (mountainous) serpentines, with narrow rural roads and vast highways leading to a modern cityscape. With licensed cars and robust tuning options it\u2019s a drifting paradise come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/01880f9a3c02c43b93b85dfd7359b491.avif?t=1769612693\" width=610 height=152 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving Models</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed primarily for gamepads, JDM boasts two driving models to choose from: Arcade, suited for a more relaxed experience and drift beginners; and Simcade in which all assists are off, trading full control over the car for more skill requirements to manage drifting. Players can switch between both models at any time during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d5845ea8e0946f381088a6af8430410c.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d5845ea8e0946f381088a6af8430410c.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d5845ea8e0946f381088a6af8430410c.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soak in the atmosphere of Japan with the fictional prefecture of Guntama, created through mixing real-life locations from all over the country. With over 250 km of visually stunning main roads, standalone racing tracks and instanced events, set across winding mountain passes, rural areas and the city's bustling streets, you\u2019ll explore diverse landscapes featuring traffic, dynamic weather, and day-night cycle systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/e75a5799300bcf2f77b21e283a0bc661.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/e75a5799300bcf2f77b21e283a0bc661.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/e75a5799300bcf2f77b21e283a0bc661.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licensed Cars</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit behind the wheel of legendary Nissan, Honda, Subaru and Mazda cars. Tune them mechanically with new parts and then fine tune the details. Experiment with visual parts: from hoods, through lights to full body kit swaps. Adjust the suspension, wheel camber, gear ratios and more. Finally, paint the car however you like using a free pick color palette. You want underglow? It\u2019s at your disposal as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/fd118425d6651ab943210da8d1c3f0ad.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/fd118425d6651ab943210da8d1c3f0ad.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/fd118425d6651ab943210da8d1c3f0ad.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven Campaign</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a foreigner determined to make his mark on the Japanese drifting scene. Compete in 40+ narrative-driven events and additional sidequests against the top drifters in the area. Experience this journey through hand-drawn manga pages, which add a unique and artistic touch to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d1d0eac16fa15ccbf2bc6a435ddae5ea.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d1d0eac16fa15ccbf2bc6a435ddae5ea.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/d1d0eac16fa15ccbf2bc6a435ddae5ea.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Audio Purr</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience authentic car sounds, captured through original recordings and brought to life with attention to detail, making you feel like you're truly behind the wheel. Cruise along picturesque roads while tuning in to genre-themed radio stations, including unique soundscapes of J-music, Phonk and even Eurobeat -  choose the perfect soundtrack for your drive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/07819ac7a8bf5782fda5166554cf53b2.poster.avif?t=1769612693\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/07819ac7a8bf5782fda5166554cf53b2.webm?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/extras/07819ac7a8bf5782fda5166554cf53b2.mp4?t=1769612693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Gaming Factory"],"dlc":[3749550,4054180],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153410/105ff87631aa74393640d23cc37269a0d8e60a82/header.jpg?t=1769612693","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1153410/1699184312/b14f6312107c15abd72354de6e35a4a5983e963a/1750629601/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747835127","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1153410/1699184312/b14f6312107c15abd72354de6e35a4a5983e963a/1750629601/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747835127","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1153410/1699184312/b14f6312107c15abd72354de6e35a4a5983e963a/1750629601/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747835127","id":257142714,"name":"JDM: Japanese Drift Master | Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142714/2390c49e56ac604e4e04e92663ec22a77e3fe1a6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747835127"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1153410/818809/88f176edac4cbbe5cae01ff1028a96542f9cf201/1750629555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737969345","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1153410/818809/88f176edac4cbbe5cae01ff1028a965